[00:00.000] 作词 : Zris
[00:00.150] 作曲 : NceS
[00:00.300]
[00:01.000]Living in the clouded dream
[00:03.070]Searching for the quiet that you need to breathe
[00:06.140]Gave up on your sanity to hide behind your shadow
[00:10.270]While you tried to take the sun down
[00:13.240]Hearts will never change to gold
[00:16.080]Out there thinking that you’re in the world alone
[00:19.150]No one ever told you that you’ll have to fight for something
[00:23.270]Or you never learn to balance
[00:27.180]It’s too cold
[00:29.030]Standing in the middle of the downfall
[00:32.140]Looking in the mirror cuz it’s only you
[00:40.120]It’s too cold
[00:42.020]Standing in the middle of the downfall
[00:45.120]Looking in the mirror cuz it’s only you
[00:49.180]When you crash and burn
